Error [jet.ReturnTypeMismatch]: This lambda parameter should be Int (a whole number), not String (text)
  --> Tests/UI/lambda_parameter_type_mismatch.jet:3:31
    |
  3 | run: fn() { print(apply(fn(n: String) { 1 })) }
    |                               ^^^^^^
